rtfelt chorus, carries firm, sincere and hopeful emotional tone, presents the theme of justice, kindness and light, complete structured progression including intro, verse, pre-chorus, chorus, bridge and fading outro with traditional oriental pentatonic scale arrangement.","[Intro - Soft Guzheng arpeggios, faint Dizi long tones, no percussion, quiet and atmospheric]\n[Verse 1 - Gentle Erhu background melody, light Yangqin plucking, slow rhythm]\n(soft steady vocal, calm and sincere delivery)\n市井烟火拂过寻常街巷\n平凡肩膀扛起岁月风霜\n也曾惶恐面对世事无常\n心底纯粹从未轻易退让\n[Pre-Chorus - Gradual soft drum entry, rising synth pad layer]\n(breathy uplifting vocal, growing emotion)\n穿过迷雾 静待天光\n微小善意 岁岁生长\n不惧世俗 纷乱过往\n守住本心 奔赴远方\n[Chorus - Full Chinese drum arrangement, layered Dizi and Guzheng harmony, rich stereo texture]\n(powerful warm vocal, firm and passionate delivery)\n渝见山河温柔 遇见正义微光\n以赤诚之心 抵世间所有寒凉\n携初心滚烫 勇敢奔赴前方\n让每份善良 都能被时光珍藏\n[Verse 2 - Balanced Erhu and Dizi duet, light percussion sustain]\n(steady tender vocal, peaceful and grateful tone)\n风雨走来依旧心怀坦荡\n知恩而行不负烟火家乡\n摒弃浮华坚守人间正向\n一念温热照亮人海茫茫\n[Pre-Chorus - Continuous rhythmic propulsion, rising instrumental layers]\n(gradually uplifting vocal, enhanced emotional expression)\n穿过迷雾 静待天光\n微小善意 岁岁生长\n不惧世俗 纷乱过往\n守住本心 奔赴远方\n[Chorus - Full instrumental arrangement, thick vocal harmony, grand and warm atmosphere]\n(powerful resonant vocal, full emotional delivery)\n渝见山河温柔 遇见正义微光\n以赤诚之心 抵世间所有寒凉\n携初心滚烫 勇敢奔赴前方\n让每份善良 都能被时光珍藏\n[Bridge - Reduced percussion, solemn Guqin long tones, empty atmospheric space]\n(low sincere vocal, deep and heartfelt delivery)\n褪去浮躁喧嚣 守住心底晴朗\n以平凡之躯 传世间温柔善良\n纵前路漫漫 始终向阳而上\n正义之风 浩荡满四方\n[Chorus - Peak dynamic range, full instrumental ensemble, strongest vocal emotion]\n(high-pitched passionate vocal, layered backing vocals)\n渝见山河温柔 遇见正义微光\n以赤诚之心 抵世间所有寒凉\n携初心滚烫 勇敢奔赴前方\n让每份善良 都能被时光珍藏\n[Outro - Instruments fade layer by layer, only faint Dizi and Guzheng residual sound, slow fade out to silence]",0,"fixed",72,200,"4","zh","E minor",true,2,0.85,0.9,0,0]},{"id":114,"type":"FxAiInputFloat","pos":[-3.152152416880139,-323.49353826577277],"size":[228.76249412082416,58],"flags":{},"order":4,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"输入数字","name":"输入数字","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"输入数字"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"输出","name":"输出","type":"FLOAT","links":[268,271]}],"properties":{"cnr_id":"fxai-toolkit","ver":"ae58547dba1ea9803f3594300158aef1abf8cbe9","Node name for S&R":"FxAiInputFloat"},"widgets_values":[240]},{"id":111,"type":"FxAiAudioManager","pos":[1178.0118988042386,-915.754328084952],"size":[1130,540],"flags":{},"order":12,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"音频","name":"音频","shape":7,"type":"AUDIO","link":267},{"localized_name":"目录","name":"目录","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"目录"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"文件夹路径","name":"文件夹路径","type":"STRING","links":null},{"localized_name":"音频总数","name":"音频总数","type":"INT","links":[274]},{"localized_name":"音频","name":"音频","type":"AUDIO","links":[]},{"localized_name":"分段列表","name":"分段列表","type":"LIST","links":null}],"properties":{"cnr_id":"fxai-toolkit","ver":"ae58547dba1ea9803f3594300158aef1abf8cbe9","Node name for S&R":"FxAiAudioManager"},"widgets_values":["音乐生成",""]},{"id":118,"type":"easy cleanGpuUsed","pos":[2342.789193037644,-855.7182617859278],"size":[140,26],"flags":{"collapsed":true},"order":65,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"label":"anything","localized_name":"输入任何","name":"anything","type":"*","link":274}],"outputs":[{"label":"output","localized_name":"output","name":"output","type":"*"}],"properties":{"cnr_id":"comfyui-easy-use","ver":"1.3.5","Node name for S&R":"easy cleanGpuUsed","ue_properties":{"version":"7.6.2","widget_ue_connectable":{},"input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":[],"shape":1}],"links":[[119,47,0,3,2,"CONDITIONING"],[175,78,0,3,0,"MODEL"],[249,98,0,3,3,"LATENT"],[254,94,0,3,1,"CONDITIONING"],[255,94,0,47,0,"CONDITIONING"],[256,3,0,18,0,"LATENT"],[260,104,0,78,0,"MODEL"],[261,105,0,94,0,"CLIP"],[262,106,0,18,